<div>
    <h1 class="text-primary">Boilerplate Template</h1>
    <h2 class="text-primary">INET2005 Web Appplication Programming I</h2>
    <p>
        This Boilerplate is a scaled version of the web app generated with "dotnet new mvc" with all unnecessary code
        removed.
    </p>

    <h3>Boilerplate template usage:</h3>
    <ol>
        <li>change name of Boilerplate.csproj to [YOUR PROJECT NAME].csproj</li>
        <li>using VS Code, find and replace all occurances of the name Boilerplate throughout the code and config files
            and change to YOUR PROJECT NAME</li>
        <li>change name of project folder itself to YOUR PROJECT NAME</li>
    </ol>

    <h3>MySQL usage:</h3>
    <ol>
        <li>Database credentials are:</li>
        <ul>
            <li>Username: root</li>
            <li>Password: secret</li>
        </ul>
        <li>Access adminer via <a href="http://localhost:8080">http://localhost:8080</a> and enter in username / password</li>
    </ol>

    <h3>Test Page</h3>
    <p>
        A test page is included to demonstrate database connectivity. Click <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Test">here</a> to view the test
        page. This should be deleted from your project once you have confirmed database connectivity.
    </p>
</div>